## 9. Region Migration

```sql
-- Add a new region to the database
ALTER DATABASE mydb ADD REGION "eu-west-1";

-- Change primary region
ALTER DATABASE mydb SET PRIMARY REGION "eu-west-1";

-- Drop old region (ONLY after data has fully rebalanced)
ALTER DATABASE mydb DROP REGION "us-east-1";

-- Monitor rebalancing progress
SELECT lease_holder, count(*) AS ranges
FROM crdb_internal.ranges
WHERE database_name = 'mydb'
GROUP BY lease_holder;
```

